  "description": "Frontegg CIAM authentication and authorization for ASP.NET Core. OpenID Connect (interactive cookie login), JWT Bearer, and Frontegg API-key schemes behind a smart policy-scheme router, with automatic token refresh, OIDC failure recovery, an optional Redis-backed cookie session store, a pluggable claims provider (roles + permissions), permission/role attributes and dynamic policies, and a fully configurable claim-type model.",
